=== AC-7 Path to Provisional Retrieval Profile ===
--- D4 components separately identifiable ---
Embedder: pinned in MEMORY_POLICY, recorded in manifest
Reranker: pinned in MEMORY_POLICY, resolved through plugin system
Vector store: SQLite + vectors table
Lexical engine: SQLite FTS5
Code intelligence: builtin generic + plugin system
Context compiler: deterministic
Router: retrieval/mod.rs multi-route fusion

