--- D5 pinned embedder governs reindex ---
Changing embedder pin triggers a full rebuild (pin_mismatch detection).
The embedder is recorded in runtime meta and index manifest.
for_query() checks live pin == policy pin (EMBEDDER_MISMATCH error).

